{"rank": 53, "root": "كسب", "form": 1, "lemma": "كَسَبَ", "count": 62, "ayahCount": 57, "share": 0.32, "meaning": {"bs": "zaraditi, steći", "en": "to earn, to gain", "tr": "kazanmak, elde etmek", "fr": "acquérir, gagner", "id": "mengusahakan, memperoleh", "ur": "کمانا، حاصل کرنا", "bn": "উপার্জন করা, অর্জন করা", "fa": "به دست آوردن، کسب کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/b8e55526630d471cb3e3.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-kasaba_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes kasaba_1-a{from{transform:rotate(-150deg)}}@keyframes kasaba_1-c{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px)}}.va-kasaba_1 .ra{transform:rotate(-70deg);animation:kasaba_1-a .35s ease-in 9 alternate both}.va-kasaba_1 .hm{stroke-width:4}.va-kasaba_1 .c1{animation:kasaba_1-c .3s ease-out .8s both}.va-kasaba_1 .c2{animation:kasaba_1-c .3s ease-out 1.6s both}.va-kasaba_1 .c3{animation:kasaba_1-c .3s ease-out 2.4s both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-kasaba_1.off,.va-kasaba_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-kasaba_1,.va-kasaba_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"p\" d=\"M66 44h32M70 44v17M94 44v17\"/><rect class=\"q\" x=\"73\" y=\"38\" width=\"9\" height=\"6\"/><rect class=\"q c1\" x=\"102\" y=\"57\" width=\"10\" height=\"3.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"q c2\" x=\"102\" y=\"52.5\" width=\"10\" height=\"3.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><rect class=\"q c3\" x=\"102\" y=\"48\" width=\"10\" height=\"3.5\" rx=\"1.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(56 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f